    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I'm writing to apply for the role of Job Title at Company Name. Say in one sentence where you saw it and why it caught your eye: something specific about the company, not the salary.",
       "format": 0,
       "style": "",
       "detail": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Pick the two or three things the advert asks for most and show you've done them. One short story beats a list of adjectives: the situation, what you did, and the result, with a number if you have one.",
       "format": 0,
       "style": "",
       "detail": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Close by saying what you'd bring in the first months, and that you'd welcome the chance to talk. Mention when you could start if it helps.",
       "format": 0,
       "style": "",
       "detail": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
